# Superseded — safe to delete

This file replaced an orphan left behind on 23 August 2026: a proposed replacement that was written
but never applied, so it sat next to the live file looking like it might be the real one.

The change it proposed has now been applied to the live file directly. There is nothing here.

**Delete this file.** If you are reading it because a tool pointed you at it, go to the file with the
same name minus `.new` — that one is current.
